 "ctr_craft_note": "Stand-in Rocket after Minecraft's firework rocket, in the original missile's proportions (12.5 x 2.5 px): red cone, pale band, red and white tube, nozzle, stick. Nose to -z; the model's middle (8, 8, 8) is the rocket's middle. Palette cells in textures/item/missile.png, see tools/make_missile_model.py."
